trong>, ainsi que des <strong data-start=3D"361" data-end=3D"380">faits mar=
quants</strong> qui ont fa=C3=A7onn=C3=A9 l=E2=80=99histoire de Java.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"418" data-end=3D"421">
<h1 data-start=3D"423" data-end=3D"501">=E2=98=95=EF=B8=8F <strong data-sta=
rt=3D"428" data-end=3D"501">Tutoriel Complet =E2=80=93 Introduction =C3=A0 =
Java : L=E2=80=99Historique du Langage Java</strong></h1>
<hr data-start=3D"503" data-end=3D"506">
<h2 data-start=3D"508" data-end=3D"542">=F0=9F=A7=AD <strong data-start=3D"=
514" data-end=3D"542">Objectifs de ce chapitre</strong></h2>
<ul data-start=3D"544" data-end=3D"871">
<li data-start=3D"544" data-end=3D"589">
<p data-start=3D"546" data-end=3D"589">Comprendre le contexte de cr=C3=A9at=
ion de Java.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"590" data-end=3D"651">
<p data-start=3D"592" data-end=3D"651">Explorer les versions majeures de Ja=
va et leurs nouveaut=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"652" data-end=3D"726">
<p data-start=3D"654" data-end=3D"726">Identifier les entit=C3=A9s cl=C3=A9=
s impliqu=C3=A9es dans son =C3=A9volution (Sun, Oracle).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"727" data-end=3D"807">
<p data-start=3D"729" data-end=3D"807">Reconna=C3=AEtre pourquoi Java est r=
est=C3=A9 un langage dominant depuis plus de 25 ans.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"808" data-end=3D"871">
<p data-start=3D"810" data-end=3D"871">Saisir les diff=C3=A9rences de philo=
sophie avec d'autres langages.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"873" data-end=3D"876">
<h2 data-start=3D"878" data-end=3D"931">=F0=9F=93=8C <strong data-start=3D"=
884" data-end=3D"931">1. Origine de Java : Le projet Green (1991)</strong><=
/h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"933" data-end=3D"987">=F0=9F=8C=B1 Contexte technologique=
 au d=C3=A9but des ann=C3=A9es 90 :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"988" data-end=3D"1265">
<li data-start=3D"988" data-end=3D"1025">
<p data-start=3D"990" data-end=3D"1025">L=E2=80=99informatique personnelle =
explose.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1026" data-end=3D"1157">
<p data-start=3D"1028" data-end=3D"1157">C=E2=80=99est l=E2=80=99=C3=A8re d=
e <strong data-start=3D"1043" data-end=3D"1052">C/C++</strong>, tr=C3=A8s p=
uissants mais complexes (gestion m=C3=A9moire manuelle, d=C3=A9pendance for=
te =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99architecture mat=C3=A9rielle).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1158" data-end=3D"1265">
<p data-start=3D"1160" data-end=3D"1265">Le march=C3=A9 de l=E2=80=99<stron=
g data-start=3D"1175" data-end=3D"1204">=C3=A9lectronique grand public</str=
ong> (TV, d=C3=A9codeurs, lecteurs CD interactifs) est en plein essor.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"1267" data-end=3D"1293">=F0=9F=91=A8=E2=80=8D=F0=9F=94=AC=
 L=E2=80=99=C3=A9quipe Green :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1294" data-end=3D"1562">
<li data-start=3D"1294" data-end=3D"1433">
<p data-start=3D"1296" data-end=3D"1433">En 1991, <strong data-start=3D"130=
5" data-end=3D"1322">James Gosling</strong>, <strong data-start=3D"1324" da=
ta-end=3D"1341">Mike Sheridan</strong> et <strong data-start=3D"1345" data-=
end=3D"1365">Patrick Naughton</strong>, chercheurs chez <strong data-start=
=3D"1383" data-end=3D"1403">Sun Microsystems</strong>, lancent le <strong d=
ata-start=3D"1416" data-end=3D"1432">Projet Green</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1434" data-end=3D"1562">
<p data-start=3D"1436" data-end=3D"1562">Objectif : cr=C3=A9er un langage i=
nd=C3=A9pendant des plateformes mat=C3=A9rielles pour piloter les <strong d=
ata-start=3D"1521" data-end=3D"1561">appareils =C3=A9lectroniques intellige=
nts</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"1564" data-end=3D"1589">=F0=9F=94=A4 Le langage "Oak" :</=
h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1590" data-end=3D"1825">
<li data-start=3D"1590" data-end=3D"1678">
<p data-start=3D"1592" data-end=3D"1678">Le langage initial s'appelait <str=
ong data-start=3D"1622" data-end=3D"1629">Oak</strong> (du nom d=E2=80=99un=
 ch=C3=AAne devant le bureau de Gosling).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1679" data-end=3D"1825">
<p data-start=3D"1681" data-end=3D"1825">Mais ce nom =C3=A9tait d=C3=A9j=C3=
=A0 pris (marque d=C3=A9pos=C3=A9e), alors ils choisirent <strong data-star=
t=3D"1748" data-end=3D"1756">Java</strong> (inspir=C3=A9 du caf=C3=A9 Java,=
 clin d=E2=80=99=C5=93il =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99=C3=A9nergie et =C3=A0 l=E2=80=99=
international).</p>
</li>
