<hr data-start=3D"1022" data-end=3D"1025">
<h2 data-start=3D"1027" data-end=3D"1058">=F0=9F=8E=AF 1. Objectifs p=C3=A9=
dagogiques</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1060" data-end=3D"1108">=C3=80 la fin de ce chapitre, vous=
 serez capable de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1110" data-end=3D"1491">
<li data-start=3D"1110" data-end=3D"1235">
<p data-start=3D"1112" data-end=3D"1235">Comprendre le r=C3=B4le des mots-c=
l=C3=A9s <strong data-start=3D"1145" data-end=3D"1156"><code data-start=3D"=
