<ul data-start=3D"6929" data-end=3D"7165">
<li data-start=3D"6929" data-end=3D"7022">
<p data-start=3D"6931" data-end=3D"7022">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"69=
33" data-end=3D"6950">Extensibilit=C3=A9</strong> : vous pouvez ajouter de =
nouveaux types sans modifier le code existant.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7023" data-end=3D"7099">
<p data-start=3D"7025" data-end=3D"7099">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"70=
27" data-end=3D"7044">R=C3=A9utilisation</strong> : des fonctions g=C3=A9n=
=C3=A9riques traitent des objets vari=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7100" data-end=3D"7165">
<p data-start=3D"7102" data-end=3D"7165">=E2=9C=85 <strong data-start=3D"71=
