<h3 data-start=3D"6392" data-end=3D"6408">=F0=9F=94=A8 Exercices</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"6410" data-end=3D"6696">
<li data-start=3D"6410" data-end=3D"6529">
<p data-start=3D"6413" data-end=3D"6529">Cr=C3=A9ez une hi=C3=A9rarchie <co=
