<hr data-start=3D"7484" data-end=3D"7487">
<h2 data-start=3D"7489" data-end=3D"7515">12. =F0=9F=93=98 Bonnes pratiques=
</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"7517" data-end=3D"7920">
<li data-start=3D"7517" data-end=3D"7583">
<p data-start=3D"7519" data-end=3D"7583">=E2=9C=85 Toujours utiliser des <s=
trong data-start=3D"7543" data-end=3D"7562">types abstraits</strong> dans l=
es signatures.</p>
