<li data-start=3D"7584" data-end=3D"7679">
<p data-start=3D"7586" data-end=3D"7679">=E2=9C=85 Privil=C3=A9gier <strong=
 data-start=3D"7600" data-end=3D"7615">l'interface</strong> ou la <strong d=
ata-start=3D"7622" data-end=3D"7639">classe parent</strong> pour la <strong=
 data-start=3D"7648" data-end=3D"7678">d=C3=A9claration des r=C3=A9f=C3=A9r=
ences</strong>.</p>
