=99est-ce qu=E2=80=99une classe abstraite ?</h2>
<p data-start=3D"2007" data-end=3D"2052">Une <strong data-start=3D"2011" da=
ta-end=3D"2031">classe abstraite</strong> est une classe qui :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2054" data-end=3D"2318">
<li data-start=3D"2054" data-end=3D"2100">
<p data-start=3D"2056" data-end=3D"2100">Ne peut <strong data-start=3D"2064=
" data-end=3D"2087">pas =C3=AAtre instanci=C3=A9e</strong> directement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2101" data-end=3D"2155">
<p data-start=3D"2103" data-end=3D"2155">Sert de <strong data-start=3D"2111=
" data-end=3D"2132">mod=C3=A8le ou de base</strong> pour d=E2=80=99autres c=
lasses.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2156" data-end=3D"2318">
<p data-start=3D"2158" data-end=3D"2173">Peut contenir :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2176" data-end=3D"2318">
<li data-start=3D"2176" data-end=3D"2224">
<p data-start=3D"2178" data-end=3D"2224">des <strong data-start=3D"2182" da=
ta-end=3D"2205">m=C3=A9thodes abstraites</strong> (non impl=C3=A9ment=C3=A9=
es)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2227" data-end=3D"2270">
<p data-start=3D"2229" data-end=3D"2270">des <strong data-start=3D"2233" da=
ta-end=3D"2255">m=C3=A9thodes concr=C3=A8tes</strong> (impl=C3=A9ment=C3=A9=
es)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2273" data-end=3D"2292">
<p data-start=3D"2275" data-end=3D"2292">des <strong data-start=3D"2279" da=
ta-end=3D"2292">attributs</strong></p>
