<p data-start=3D"1039" data-end=3D"1055">&lt;a name=3D"1"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"1056" data-end=3D"1096">1. =F0=9F=94=8D Introduction =C3=
=A0 la S=C3=A9rialisation</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"1098" data-end=3D"1134">Qu=E2=80=99est-ce que la s=C3=A9r=
ialisation ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1135" data-end=3D"1242">La <strong data-start=3D"1138" dat=
a-end=3D"1155">s=C3=A9rialisation</strong> est le processus de <strong data=
-start=3D"1176" data-end=3D"1231">conversion d=E2=80=99un objet Java en une=
 s=C3=A9quence d=E2=80=99octets</strong>, afin de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1243" data-end=3D"1354">
<li data-start=3D"1243" data-end=3D"1275">
<p data-start=3D"1245" data-end=3D"1275">le <strong data-start=3D"1248" dat=
a-end=3D"1275">stocker dans un fichier</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1276" data-end=3D"1310">
<p data-start=3D"1278" data-end=3D"1310">le <strong data-start=3D"1281" dat=
a-end=3D"1296">transmettre</strong> sur un r=C3=A9seau</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1311" data-end=3D"1354">
<p data-start=3D"1313" data-end=3D"1354">le <strong data-start=3D"1316" dat=
a-end=3D"1329">m=C3=A9moriser</strong> dans une base de donn=C3=A9es</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1356" data-end=3D"1437">L=E2=80=99inverse (r=C3=A9cup=C3=
=A9rer l=E2=80=99objet =C3=A0 partir d=E2=80=99octets) s=E2=80=99appelle la=
 <strong data-start=3D"1417" data-end=3D"1436">d=C3=A9s=C3=A9rialisation</s=
trong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1439" data-end=3D"1442">
<h3 data-start=3D"1444" data-end=3D"1484">Pourquoi utiliser la s=C3=A9riali=
sation ?</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"1485" data-end=3D"1620">
<li data-start=3D"1485" data-end=3D"1516">
<p data-start=3D"1487" data-end=3D"1516">Stocker des objets sur disque</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1517" data-end=3D"1560">
<p data-start=3D"1519" data-end=3D"1560">Envoyer des objets via des sockets=
 ou RMI</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1561" data-end=3D"1620">
<p data-start=3D"1563" data-end=3D"1620">Sauvegarder des =C3=A9tats d'appli=
cation (comme dans des jeux)</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"1622" data-end=3D"1625">
<p data-start=3D"1627" data-end=3D"1643">&lt;a name=3D"2"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
