></strong> : Temps qu=E2=80=99un thread inactif attend avant d=E2=80=99=C3=
=AAtre supprim=C3=A9.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6528" data-end=3D"6585">
<p data-start=3D"6530" data-end=3D"6585"><strong data-start=3D"6530" data-e=
nd=3D"6545"><code data-start=3D"6532" data-end=3D"6543">workQueue</code></s=
trong> : File d=E2=80=99attente des t=C3=A2ches =C3=A0 ex=C3=A9cuter.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"6587" data-end=3D"6590">
<p data-start=3D"6592" data-end=3D"6608">&lt;a name=3D"8"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"6609" data-end=3D"6646">8. =F0=9F=A7=B0 Gestion de la Tai=
lle du Pool</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6648" data-end=3D"6789">Un aspect important dans l'utilisa=
tion des pools de threads est <strong data-start=3D"6712" data-end=3D"6738"=
>l'ajustement dynamique</strong> de la taille du pool. Voici quelques point=
s cl=C3=A9s :</p>
<ol data-start=3D"6791" data-end=3D"7066">
<li data-start=3D"6791" data-end=3D"6876">
<p data-start=3D"6794" data-end=3D"6876"><strong data-start=3D"6794" data-e=
nd=3D"6812">Core Pool Size</strong> : Le nombre de threads permanents qui s=
eront toujours pr=C3=A9sents.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6877" data-end=3D"6974">
<p data-start=3D"6880" data-end=3D"6974"><strong data-start=3D"6880" data-e=
nd=3D"6901">Maximum Pool Size</strong> : Le nombre maximal de threads pouva=
nt =C3=AAtre cr=C3=A9=C3=A9s si la charge augmente.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6975" data-end=3D"7066">
<p data-start=3D"6978" data-end=3D"7066"><strong data-start=3D"6978" data-e=
nd=3D"6997">Keep Alive Time</strong> : Le d=C3=A9lai d'inactivit=C3=A9 apr=
=C3=A8s lequel un thread inactif sera d=C3=A9truit.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"7068" data-end=3D"7172">Vous pouvez ajuster ces param=C3=
=A8tres en fonction de votre charge de travail et des ressources disponible=
s.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"7174" data-end=3D"7177">
<p data-start=3D"7179" data-end=3D"7195">&lt;a name=3D"9"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
