<p data-start=3D"1007" data-end=3D"1023">&lt;a name=3D"1"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"1024" data-end=3D"1070">1. =F0=9F=94=8D Introduction =C3=
=A0 la Concurrence en Java</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1072" data-end=3D"1420">La programmation <strong data-star=
t=3D"1089" data-end=3D"1104">concurrente</strong> en Java permet d'ex=C3=A9=
cuter plusieurs t=C3=A2ches en parall=C3=A8le, ce qui peut am=C3=A9liorer l=
'efficacit=C3=A9 et les performances d'un programme. <strong data-start=3D"=
1233" data-end=3D"1254">Le multithreading</strong> (utilisation de plusieur=
s threads d'ex=C3=A9cution) est un aspect fondamental de la concurrence. Ce=
pendant, la gestion des threads peut =C3=AAtre complexe et source d'erreurs=
.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1422" data-end=3D"1655">Pour faciliter la gestion des t=C3=
=A2ches concurrentes et multithread=C3=A9es, Java met =C3=A0 disposition l'=
<strong data-start=3D"1516" data-end=3D"1546">API <code data-start=3D"1522"=
 data-end=3D"1544">java.util.concurrent</code></strong>, qui fournit des cl=
asses et interfaces puissantes comme <code data-start=3D"1603" data-end=3D"=
1620">ExecutorService</code>, <code data-start=3D"1622" data-end=3D"1630">F=
uture</code>, et <code data-start=3D"1635" data-end=3D"1654">CompletableFut=
ure</code>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1657" data-end=3D"1660">
<p data-start=3D"1662" data-end=3D"1678">&lt;a name=3D"2"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"1679" data-end=3D"1716">2. =F0=9F=93=A6 L'API <code data-=
start=3D"1694" data-end=3D"1716">java.util.concurrent</code></h2>
<p data-start=3D"1718" data-end=3D"1890">L'API <strong data-start=3D"1724" =
data-end=3D"1750"><code data-start=3D"1726" data-end=3D"1748">java.util.con=
current</code></strong> introduite dans Java 5 permet de simplifier la gest=
ion des threads et de la concurrence. Elle fournit des interfaces et des cl=
asses comme :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1892" data-end=3D"2270">
<li data-start=3D"1892" data-end=3D"1948">
<p data-start=3D"1894" data-end=3D"1948"><strong data-start=3D"1894" data-e=
nd=3D"1915"><code data-start=3D"1896" data-end=3D"1913">ExecutorService</co=
de></strong> : Pour g=C3=A9rer un pool de threads.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1949" data-end=3D"2040">
<p data-start=3D"1951" data-end=3D"2040"><strong data-start=3D"1951" data-e=
nd=3D"1963"><code data-start=3D"1953" data-end=3D"1961">Future</code></stro=
ng> : Pour repr=C3=A9senter le r=C3=A9sultat d'une t=C3=A2che qui sera ex=
=C3=A9cut=C3=A9e ult=C3=A9rieurement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2041" data-end=3D"2157">
<p data-start=3D"2043" data-end=3D"2157"><strong data-start=3D"2043" data-e=
nd=3D"2066"><code data-start=3D"2045" data-end=3D"2064">CompletableFuture</=
code></strong> : Une extension de <code data-start=3D"2086" data-end=3D"209=
4">Future</code> qui permet de construire des cha=C3=AEnes d'op=C3=A9ration=
s asynchrones.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2158" data-end=3D"2270">
<p data-start=3D"2160" data-end=3D"2270"><strong data-start=3D"2160" data-e=
nd=3D"2210"><code data-start=3D"2162" data-end=3D"2178">CountDownLatch</cod=
e>, <code data-start=3D"2180" data-end=3D"2191">Semaphore</code>, <code dat=
a-start=3D"2193" data-end=3D"2208">CyclicBarrier</code></strong> : Pour la =
synchronisation et la coordination entre threads.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"2272" data-end=3D"2350">Ce tutoriel se concentrera sur deu=
x classes : <code data-start=3D"2318" data-end=3D"2326">Future</code> et <c=
ode data-start=3D"2330" data-end=3D"2349">CompletableFuture</code>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"2352" data-end=3D"2355">
<p data-start=3D"2357" data-end=3D"2373">&lt;a name=3D"3"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"2374" data-end=3D"2408">3. =E2=8F=B3 Qu'est-ce qu'un <cod=
e data-start=3D"2398" data-end=3D"2406">Future</code> ?</h2>
<p data-start=3D"2410" data-end=3D"2654">Un <strong data-start=3D"2413" dat=
a-end=3D"2425"><code data-start=3D"2415" data-end=3D"2423">Future</code></s=
trong> repr=C3=A9sente le r=C3=A9sultat d'une op=C3=A9ration asynchrone qui=
 peut =C3=AAtre obtenue dans le futur. Il fournit une interface pour r=C3=
=A9cup=C3=A9rer le r=C3=A9sultat d'une t=C3=A2che ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9e dans u=
n thread s=C3=A9par=C3=A9, ou pour v=C3=A9rifier si cette t=C3=A2che est te=
rmin=C3=A9e.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2656" data-end=3D"2706">M=C3=A9thodes principales de l'in=
terface <code data-start=3D"2696" data-end=3D"2704">Future</code> :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2707" data-end=3D"3358">
<li data-start=3D"2707" data-end=3D"2878">
<p data-start=3D"2709" data-end=3D"2878"><strong data-start=3D"2709" data-e=
nd=3D"2720"><code data-start=3D"2711" data-end=3D"2718">get()</code></stron=
g> : R=C3=A9cup=C3=A8re le r=C3=A9sultat de la t=C3=A2che une fois termin=
=C3=A9e. Si la t=C3=A2che n'est pas encore termin=C3=A9e, cette m=C3=A9thod=
e bloque jusqu'=C3=A0 ce que le r=C3=A9sultat soit disponible.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2879" data-end=3D"3065">
<p data-start=3D"2881" data-end=3D"3065"><strong data-start=3D"2881" data-e=
nd=3D"2919"><code data-start=3D"2883" data-end=3D"2917">get(long timeout, T=
imeUnit unit)</code></strong> : R=C3=A9cup=C3=A8re le r=C3=A9sultat avec un=
 d=C3=A9lai d'attente. Si la t=C3=A2che ne se termine pas dans le temps imp=
arti, une exception <code data-start=3D"3035" data-end=3D"3053">TimeoutExce=
ption</code> est lanc=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3066" data-end=3D"3246">
<p data-start=3D"3068" data-end=3D"3246"><strong data-start=3D"3068" data-e=
nd=3D"3111"><code data-start=3D"3070" data-end=3D"3109">cancel(boolean mayI=
nterruptIfRunning)</code></strong> : Annule la t=C3=A2che si elle n'est pas=
 encore termin=C3=A9e. Le param=C3=A8tre <code data-start=3D"3178" data-end=
=3D"3201">mayInterruptIfRunning</code> d=C3=A9termine si le thread doit =C3=
=AAtre interrompu.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3247" data-end=3D"3299">
<p data-start=3D"3249" data-end=3D"3299"><strong data-start=3D"3249" data-e=
nd=3D"3263"><code data-start=3D"3251" data-end=3D"3261">isDone()</code></st=
rong> : V=C3=A9rifie si la t=C3=A2che est termin=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3300" data-end=3D"3358">
<p data-start=3D"3302" data-end=3D"3358"><strong data-start=3D"3302" data-e=
nd=3D"3321"><code data-start=3D"3304" data-end=3D"3319">isCancelled()</code=
></strong> : V=C3=A9rifie si la t=C3=A2che a =C3=A9t=C3=A9 annul=C3=A9e.</p=
>
</li>
</ul>
