<p data-start=3D"5924" data-end=3D"5940">&lt;a name=3D"5"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"5941" data-end=3D"5984">5. =F0=9F=94=84 Introduction =C3=
=A0 <code data-start=3D"5965" data-end=3D"5984">CompletableFuture</code></h=
2>
<p data-start=3D"5986" data-end=3D"6347">Un <strong data-start=3D"5989" dat=
a-end=3D"6012"><code data-start=3D"5991" data-end=3D"6010">CompletableFutur=
e</code></strong> est une extension de <strong data-start=3D"6034" data-end=
=3D"6046"><code data-start=3D"6036" data-end=3D"6044">Future</code></strong=
> qui permet de construire des cha=C3=AEnes d'op=C3=A9rations asynchrones. =
Contrairement =C3=A0 <code data-start=3D"6126" data-end=3D"6134">Future</co=
de>, qui est limit=C3=A9 =C3=A0 une t=C3=A2che de r=C3=A9cup=C3=A9ration de=
 r=C3=A9sultat, <strong data-start=3D"6192" data-end=3D"6215"><code data-st=
art=3D"6194" data-end=3D"6213">CompletableFuture</code></strong> permet de =
combiner plusieurs t=C3=A2ches asynchrones, d'appliquer des transformations=
 et de g=C3=A9rer les exceptions de mani=C3=A8re plus fluide.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"6349" data-end=3D"6398">M=C3=A9thodes principales de <cod=
e data-start=3D"6377" data-end=3D"6396">CompletableFuture</code> :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"6399" data-end=3D"6972">
<li data-start=3D"6399" data-end=3D"6521">
<p data-start=3D"6401" data-end=3D"6521"><strong data-start=3D"6401" data-e=
nd=3D"6440"><code data-start=3D"6403" data-end=3D"6438">supplyAsync(Supplie=
r&lt;U&gt; supplier)</code></strong> : Lance une t=C3=A2che asynchrone et r=
envoie un <code data-start=3D"6484" data-end=3D"6503">CompletableFuture</co=
de> avec le r=C3=A9sultat.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6522" data-end=3D"6654">
<p data-start=3D"6524" data-end=3D"6654"><strong data-start=3D"6524" data-e=
nd=3D"6558"><code data-start=3D"6526" data-end=3D"6556">thenApply(Function&=
lt;T, U&gt; fn)</code></strong> : Applique une fonction apr=C3=A8s la compl=
=C3=A9tion de la t=C3=A2che, retourne un autre <code data-start=3D"6634" da=
ta-end=3D"6653">CompletableFuture</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6655" data-end=3D"6743">
<p data-start=3D"6657" data-end=3D"6743"><strong data-start=3D"6657" data-e=
nd=3D"6693"><code data-start=3D"6659" data-end=3D"6691">thenAccept(Consumer=
&lt;T&gt; action)</code></strong> : Effectue une action sans retourner de r=
=C3=A9sultat.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6744" data-end=3D"6890">
<p data-start=3D"6746" data-end=3D"6890"><strong data-start=3D"6746" data-e=
nd=3D"6815"><code data-start=3D"6748" data-end=3D"6813">thenCombine(Complet=
ableFuture&lt;U&gt; other, BiFunction&lt;T, U, V&gt; fn)</code></strong> : =
Combine deux <code data-start=3D"6831" data-end=3D"6850">CompletableFuture<=
/code> lorsqu'ils sont tous les deux termin=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6891" data-end=3D"6972">
<p data-start=3D"6893" data-end=3D"6972"><strong data-start=3D"6893" data-e=
nd=3D"6949"><code data-start=3D"6895" data-end=3D"6947">exceptionally(Funct=
ion&lt;Throwable, ? extends T&gt; fn)</code></strong> : G=C3=A8re les excep=
tions.</p>
</li>
</ul>
