nd=3D"6347"><code data-start=3D"6333" data-end=3D"6345">@BeforeAll</code></=
strong> : Remplace <code data-start=3D"6359" data-end=3D"6373">@BeforeClass=
</code>, ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9 une fois avant tous les tests.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6414" data-end=3D"6496">
<p data-start=3D"6416" data-end=3D"6496"><strong data-start=3D"6416" data-e=
nd=3D"6431"><code data-start=3D"6418" data-end=3D"6429">@AfterAll</code></s=
trong> : Remplace <code data-start=3D"6443" data-end=3D"6456">@AfterClass</=
code>, ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9 une fois apr=C3=A8s tous les tests.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6497" data-end=3D"6535">
<p data-start=3D"6499" data-end=3D"6535"><strong data-start=3D"6499" data-e=
nd=3D"6514"><code data-start=3D"6501" data-end=3D"6512">@Disabled</code></s=
trong> : D=C3=A9sactive un test.</p>
</li>
</ul>
