rtion pour comparer des valeurs attendues et r=C3=A9elles.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"2297" data-end=3D"2328">Types d'Assertions en JUnit</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"2330" data-end=3D"4208">
<li data-start=3D"2330" data-end=3D"2507">
<p data-start=3D"2333" data-end=3D"2415"><strong data-start=3D"2333" data-e=
nd=3D"2369"><code data-start=3D"2335" data-end=3D"2367">assertEquals(expect=
