<li data-start=3D"7368" data-end=3D"7416">
<p data-start=3D"7370" data-end=3D"7416">Exemple : <code data-start=3D"7380=
" data-end=3D"7390">MAX_SIZE</code>, <code data-start=3D"7392" data-end=3D"=
7396">PI</code>, <code data-start=3D"7398" data-end=3D"7415">DEFAULT_TIMEOU=
T</code>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"7418" data-end=3D"7459">8.2 Conventions pour les =C3=A9nu=
m=C3=A9rations</h3>
