<h3 data-start=3D"1198" data-end=3D"1225">2.1 <strong data-start=3D"1206" d=
ata-end=3D"1225">Principe du DRY</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"1227" data-end=3D"1561">Le principe <strong data-start=3D"=
1239" data-end=3D"1246">DRY</strong> stipule que <strong data-start=3D"1259=
" data-end=3D"1301">"vous ne devez pas r=C3=A9p=C3=A9ter votre code"</stron=
