<h3 data-start=3D"7557" data-end=3D"7587">4.3 <strong data-start=3D"7565" d=
ata-end=3D"7587">Avantages de SOLID</strong></h3>
<ul data-start=3D"7588" data-end=3D"7897">
<li data-start=3D"7588" data-end=3D"7659">
<p data-start=3D"7590" data-end=3D"7659"><strong data-start=3D"7590" data-e=
nd=3D"7609">R=C3=A9utilisabilit=C3=A9</strong> : Le code devient plus modul=
aire et r=C3=A9utilisable.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7660" data-end=3D"7771">
<p data-start=3D"7662" data-end=3D"7771"><strong data-start=3D"7662" data-e=
nd=3D"7679">Extensibilit=C3=A9</strong> : Il est plus facile d'ajouter de n=
ouvelles fonctionnalit=C3=A9s sans affecter le code existant.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7772" data-end=3D"7897">
<p data-start=3D"7774" data-end=3D"7897"><strong data-start=3D"7774" data-e=
nd=3D"7789">Maintenance</strong> : Chaque classe =C3=A9tant responsable d=
=E2=80=99un seul aspect, il devient facile de localiser et de corriger des =
bugs.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"7899" data-end=3D"7902">
<p data-start=3D"7904" data-end=3D"7920">&lt;a name=3D"5"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"7921" data-end=3D"7983">5. =F0=9F=A7=BC <strong data-star=
t=3D"7930" data-end=3D"7983">Clean Code - =C3=89crire un code propre et mai=
ntenable</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"7985" data-end=3D"8020">5.1 <strong data-start=3D"7993" d=
ata-end=3D"8020">Principes de Clean Code</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"8022" data-end=3D"8087">Le principe de <strong data-start=
=3D"8037" data-end=3D"8051">Clean Code</strong> consiste =C3=A0 =C3=A9crire=
 un code qui est :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"8088" data-end=3D"8367">
<li data-start=3D"8088" data-end=3D"8134">
<p data-start=3D"8090" data-end=3D"8134"><strong data-start=3D"8090" data-e=
nd=3D"8101">Lisible</strong> : Facile =C3=A0 lire et =C3=A0 comprendre.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8135" data-end=3D"8215">
<p data-start=3D"8137" data-end=3D"8215"><strong data-start=3D"8137" data-e=
nd=3D"8152">Maintenable</strong> : Facile =C3=A0 modifier et =C3=A0 =C3=A9t=
endre sans casser le code existant.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8216" data-end=3D"8285">
<p data-start=3D"8218" data-end=3D"8285"><strong data-start=3D"8218" data-e=
nd=3D"8230">Testable</strong> : Facile =C3=A0 tester, avec une bonne couver=
ture de tests.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8286" data-end=3D"8367">
<p data-start=3D"8288" data-end=3D"8367"><strong data-start=3D"8288" data-e=
nd=3D"8301">Efficient</strong> : R=C3=A9sout le probl=C3=A8me de mani=C3=A8=
re optimale sans complexit=C3=A9 inutile.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"8369" data-end=3D"8405">5.2 <strong data-start=3D"8377" d=
ata-end=3D"8405">Les r=C3=A8gles de Clean Code</strong></h3>
<ol data-start=3D"8406" data-end=3D"9184">
<li data-start=3D"8406" data-end=3D"8527">
<p data-start=3D"8409" data-end=3D"8527"><strong data-start=3D"8409" data-e=
nd=3D"8441">Utilisez des noms explicites</strong> : Le nom des variables, m=
=C3=A9thodes et classes doit d=C3=A9crire leur r=C3=B4le de mani=C3=A8re cl=
aire.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8532" data-end=3D"8742">
<p data-start=3D"8535" data-end=3D"8742"><strong data-start=3D"8535" data-e=
nd=3D"8571">=C3=89vitez les commentaires inutiles</strong> : Un code propre=
 doit =C3=AAtre suffisamment clair pour ne pas n=C3=A9cessiter de commentai=
res suppl=C3=A9mentaires. Si vous devez commenter, faites-le de mani=C3=A8r=
e concise et pertinente.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8747" data-end=3D"8896">
<p data-start=3D"8750" data-end=3D"8896"><strong data-start=3D"8750" data-e=
nd=3D"8784">Limitez la taille des m=C3=A9thodes</strong> : Chaque m=C3=A9th=
ode doit accomplir une seule t=C3=A2che. Les m=C3=A9thodes longues sont dif=
ficiles =C3=A0 comprendre et =C3=A0 tester.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8898" data-end=3D"9055">
<p data-start=3D"8901" data-end=3D"9055"><strong data-start=3D"8901" data-e=
nd=3D"8935">Respectez la structure du code</strong> : Organisez votre code =
avec des conventions de style (indentation, espaces, etc.) et suivez un for=
mat de code coh=C3=A9rent.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9057" data-end=3D"9184">
<p data-start=3D"9060" data-end=3D"9184"><strong data-start=3D"9060" data-e=
nd=3D"9090">Refactorisez r=C3=A9guli=C3=A8rement</strong> : Revoyez et am=
=C3=A9liorez continuellement votre code pour le rendre plus simple et plus =
lisible.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 data-start=3D"9186" data-end=3D"9219">5.3 <strong data-start=3D"9194" d=
ata-end=3D"9219">Exemple de Clean Code</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"9221" data-end=3D"9280">Un exemple de code respectant les =
principes de Clean Code :</p>
