<p data-start=3D"3335" data-end=3D"3351">&lt;a name=3D"4"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"3352" data-end=3D"3380">4. =F0=9F=93=A6 Introduction =C3=
=A0 REST</h2>
<p data-start=3D"3382" data-end=3D"3547"><strong data-start=3D"3382" data-e=
nd=3D"3390">REST</strong> est une architecture d=E2=80=99API web d=C3=A9fin=
ie par Roy Fielding dans sa th=C3=A8se (2000). Elle permet la communication=
 entre syst=C3=A8mes distribu=C3=A9s en s=E2=80=99appuyant sur HTTP.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3549" data-end=3D"3567">&lt;a name=3D"4.1"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</=
p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3568" data-end=3D"3593">4.1 Principes de base</h3>
<ol data-start=3D"3595" data-end=3D"3883">
<li data-start=3D"3595" data-end=3D"3659">
<p data-start=3D"3598" data-end=3D"3659"><strong data-start=3D"3598" data-e=
nd=3D"3611">Stateless</strong> : aucune information de session sur le serve=
ur.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3660" data-end=3D"3715">
<p data-start=3D"3663" data-end=3D"3715"><strong data-start=3D"3663" data-e=
nd=3D"3681">Client-Serveur</strong> : s=C3=A9paration des responsabilit=C3=
=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3716" data-end=3D"3776">
<p data-start=3D"3719" data-end=3D"3776"><strong data-start=3D"3719" data-e=
nd=3D"3732">Cacheable</strong> : les r=C3=A9ponses peuvent =C3=AAtre mises =
en cache.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3777" data-end=3D"3834">
<p data-start=3D"3780" data-end=3D"3834"><strong data-start=3D"3780" data-e=
nd=3D"3801">Uniform Interface</strong> : acc=C3=A8s uniforme aux ressources=
.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3835" data-end=3D"3883">
<p data-start=3D"3838" data-end=3D"3883"><strong data-start=3D"3838" data-e=
nd=3D"3856">Layered System</strong> : architecture en couches.</p>
</li>
</ol>
