<p data-start=3D"1358" data-end=3D"1374">&lt;a name=3D"1"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"1375" data-end=3D"1396">1. =F0=9F=94=B0 Introduction</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1398" data-end=3D"1586">Dans une architecture web Java, le=
