rong> entre les <strong data-start=3D"1491" data-end=3D"1507">clients HTTP<=
/strong> (navigateur, app mobile, etc.) et les <strong data-start=3D"1546" =
data-end=3D"1568">ressources serveur</strong>. Ils manipulent :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1588" data-end=3D"1701">
<li data-start=3D"1588" data-end=3D"1641">
<p data-start=3D"1590" data-end=3D"1641">des <strong data-start=3D"1594" da=
ta-end=3D"1611">requ=C3=AAtes HTTP</strong> re=C3=A7ues (<code data-start=
