<p data-start=3D"1378" data-end=3D"1394">&lt;a name=3D"1"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"1395" data-end=3D"1455">1. =F0=9F=94=B0 Introduction =C3=
=A0 la s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 web et =C3=A0 Spring Security</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"1457" data-end=3D"1501">Pourquoi s=C3=A9curiser une appli=
cation web ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1503" data-end=3D"1563">Une application web est vuln=C3=A9=
rable =C3=A0 de nombreuses menaces :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1565" data-end=3D"1706">
<li data-start=3D"1565" data-end=3D"1584">
<p data-start=3D"1567" data-end=3D"1584"><strong data-start=3D"1567" data-e=
nd=3D"1584">Injection SQL</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1585" data-end=3D"1617">
<p data-start=3D"1587" data-end=3D"1617"><strong data-start=3D"1587" data-e=
nd=3D"1617">XSS (Cross Site Scripting)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1618" data-end=3D"1657">
<p data-start=3D"1620" data-end=3D"1657"><strong data-start=3D"1620" data-e=
nd=3D"1657">CSRF (Cross Site Request Forgery)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1658" data-end=3D"1682">
<p data-start=3D"1660" data-end=3D"1682"><strong data-start=3D"1660" data-e=
nd=3D"1682">Vol d=E2=80=99identifiants</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1683" data-end=3D"1706">
<p data-start=3D"1685" data-end=3D"1706"><strong data-start=3D"1685" data-e=
nd=3D"1706">Abus des API REST</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"1708" data-end=3D"1738">Pourquoi Spring Security ?</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1740" data-end=3D"1852">Spring Security est un <strong dat=
a-start=3D"1763" data-end=3D"1837">framework de s=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 puissant=
, personnalisable, extensible et int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9</strong> =C3=A0 Spring B=
oot.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1854" data-end=3D"1887"><strong data-start=3D"1854" data-e=
nd=3D"1887">Fonctionnalit=C3=A9s principales :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"1889" data-end=3D"2107">
<li data-start=3D"1889" data-end=3D"1945">
<p data-start=3D"1891" data-end=3D"1945">Authentification (Form, HTTP Basic=
, LDAP, OAuth2, JWT)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1946" data-end=3D"1980">
<p data-start=3D"1948" data-end=3D"1980">Autorisation bas=C3=A9e sur les r=
=C3=B4les</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1981" data-end=3D"2004">
<p data-start=3D"1983" data-end=3D"2004">Protection CSRF, CORS</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2005" data-end=3D"2063">
<p data-start=3D"2007" data-end=3D"2063">S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 au niveau m=C3=
=A9thode (<code data-start=3D"2035" data-end=3D"2045">@Secured</code>, <cod=
e data-start=3D"2047" data-end=3D"2062">@PreAuthorize</code>)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2064" data-end=3D"2107">
<p data-start=3D"2066" data-end=3D"2107">Int=C3=A9gration avec les syst=C3=
=A8mes d=E2=80=99identit=C3=A9s</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2109" data-end=3D"2112">
<p data-start=3D"2114" data-end=3D"2130">&lt;a name=3D"2"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"2131" data-end=3D"2171">2. =F0=9F=A7=B1 Architecture de S=
pring Security</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"2173" data-end=3D"2218">=F0=9F=94=84 Filtre central : <co=
de data-start=3D"2197" data-end=3D"2218">SecurityFilterChain</code></h3>
<p data-start=3D"2220" data-end=3D"2337">Spring Security fonctionne en ins=
=C3=A9rant une <strong data-start=3D"2263" data-end=3D"2302">cha=C3=AEne de=
 filtres (Servlet Filters)</strong> dans le pipeline de requ=C3=AAtes HTTP.=
</p>
<p data-start=3D"2339" data-end=3D"2360">Exemples de filtres :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"2362" data-end=3D"2482">
<li data-start=3D"2362" data-end=3D"2402">
<p data-start=3D"2364" data-end=3D"2402"><code data-start=3D"2364" data-end=
=3D"2402">UsernamePasswordAuthenticationFilter</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2403" data-end=3D"2430">
<p data-start=3D"2405" data-end=3D"2430"><code data-start=3D"2405" data-end=
=3D"2430">JwtAuthenticationFilter</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2431" data-end=3D"2467">
<p data-start=3D"2433" data-end=3D"2467"><code data-start=3D"2433" data-end=
=3D"2467">SecurityContextPersistenceFilter</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2468" data-end=3D"2482">
<p data-start=3D"2470" data-end=3D"2482"><code data-start=3D"2470" data-end=
=3D"2482">CsrfFilter</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"2484" data-end=3D"2519">=F0=9F=94=90 Moteurs d=E2=80=99au=
thentification :</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2521" data-end=3D"2670">
<li data-start=3D"2521" data-end=3D"2573">
<p data-start=3D"2523" data-end=3D"2573"><code data-start=3D"2523" data-end=
=3D"2546">AuthenticationManager</code> : orchestre les m=C3=A9canismes</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2574" data-end=3D"2622">
<p data-start=3D"2576" data-end=3D"2622"><code data-start=3D"2576" data-end=
=3D"2596">UserDetailsService</code> : charge les utilisateurs</p>
</li>
