<p data-start=3D"1279" data-end=3D"1330"><strong data-start=3D"1279" data-e=
nd=3D"1292">Coh=C3=A9rente</strong> : la base reste dans un =C3=A9tat valid=
e</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1331" data-end=3D"1398">
<p data-start=3D"1333" data-end=3D"1398"><strong data-start=3D"1333" data-e=
nd=3D"1343">Isol=C3=A9e</strong> : les transactions concurrentes ne se pert=
urbent pas</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1399" data-end=3D"1463">
<p data-start=3D"1401" data-end=3D"1463"><strong data-start=3D"1401" data-e=
nd=3D"1412">Durable</strong> : une fois valid=C3=A9e, la transaction est pe=
rsist=C3=A9e</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1465" data-end=3D"1508">Ces propri=C3=A9t=C3=A9s forment l=
=E2=80=99acronyme <strong data-start=3D"1499" data-end=3D"1507">ACID</stron=
g>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1510" data-end=3D"1637">En JDBC, g=C3=A9rer les transactio=
ns signifie contr=C3=B4ler quand valider (<code data-start=3D"1576" data-en=
d=3D"1584">commit</code>) ou annuler (<code data-start=3D"1598" data-end=3D=
"1608">rollback</code>) un groupe d=E2=80=99op=C3=A9rations SQL.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1639" data-end=3D"1642">
<p data-start=3D"1644" data-end=3D"1660">&lt;a name=3D"2"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"1661" data-end=3D"1697">2. Concepts cl=C3=A9s des transac=
tions</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"1699" data-end=3D"2232">
<li data-start=3D"1699" data-end=3D"1794">
<p data-start=3D"1701" data-end=3D"1794"><strong data-start=3D"1701" data-e=
nd=3D"1711">Commit</strong> : validation de la transaction =E2=86=92 les ch=
angements sont enregistr=C3=A9s d=C3=A9finitivement</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1795" data-end=3D"1885">
<p data-start=3D"1797" data-end=3D"1885"><strong data-start=3D"1797" data-e=
nd=3D"1809">Rollback</strong> : annulation =E2=86=92 les changements effect=
u=C3=A9s dans la transaction sont annul=C3=A9s</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1886" data-end=3D"1983">
<p data-start=3D"1888" data-end=3D"1983"><strong data-start=3D"1888" data-e=
nd=3D"1903">Auto-commit</strong> : mode par d=C3=A9faut en JDBC o=C3=B9 cha=
que instruction SQL est valid=C3=A9e imm=C3=A9diatement</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1984" data-end=3D"2107">
<p data-start=3D"1986" data-end=3D"2107"><strong data-start=3D"1986" data-e=
nd=3D"1999">Isolation</strong> : contr=C3=B4le du niveau d=E2=80=99interf=
=C3=A9rence entre transactions concurrentes (ex : lecture fant=C3=B4me, non=
 r=C3=A9p=C3=A9table)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2108" data-end=3D"2232">
<p data-start=3D"2110" data-end=3D"2232"><strong data-start=3D"2110" data-e=
nd=3D"2145">Point de sauvegarde (Savepoint)</strong> : point dans la transa=
ction auquel on peut revenir sans annuler toute la transaction</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"2234" data-end=3D"2237">
<p data-start=3D"2239" data-end=3D"2255">&lt;a name=3D"3"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"2256" data-end=3D"2307">3. Transactions en JDBC : fonctio=
