<p data-start=3D"3728" data-end=3D"3744">&lt;a name=3D"5"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"3745" data-end=3D"3802">5. Gestion automatique des transa=
ctions et auto-commit</h2>
<p data-start=3D"3804" data-end=3D"3902">En mode <strong data-start=3D"3812=
" data-end=3D"3834">auto-commit =3D true</strong> (par d=C3=A9faut), chaque=
 instruction SQL est valid=C3=A9e d=C3=A8s son ex=C3=A9cution.</p>
<p data-start=3D"3904" data-end=3D"3917"><strong data-start=3D"3904" data-e=
nd=3D"3915">Limites</strong> :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"3919" data-end=3D"4102">
<li data-start=3D"3919" data-end=3D"3965">
<p data-start=3D"3921" data-end=3D"3965">Pas de regroupement logique des op=
=C3=A9rations</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3966" data-end=3D"4032">
<p data-start=3D"3968" data-end=3D"4032">Impossible d=E2=80=99annuler un gr=
oupe d=E2=80=99op=C3=A9rations en cas de probl=C3=A8me</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4033" data-end=3D"4102">
<p data-start=3D"4035" data-end=3D"4102">Usage d=C3=A9conseill=C3=A9 dans l=
a plupart des applications multi-requ=C3=AAtes</p>
</li>
</ul>
