023" data-end=3D"6030">fetch</code> (Lazy vs Eager).</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6049" data-end=3D"6052">
<p data-start=3D"6054" data-end=3D"6070">&lt;a name=3D"8"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"6071" data-end=3D"6106">8. Cycle de vie d=E2=80=99une ent=
it=C3=A9 JPA</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6108" data-end=3D"6145">Une entit=C3=A9 traverse plusieurs=
 =C3=A9tats :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"6147" data-end=3D"6410">
<li data-start=3D"6147" data-end=3D"6216">
<p data-start=3D"6149" data-end=3D"6216"><strong data-start=3D"6149" data-e=
nd=3D"6168">New (transient)</strong> : nouvel objet Java non attach=C3=A9 =
=C3=A0 une session</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6217" data-end=3D"6288">
<p data-start=3D"6219" data-end=3D"6288"><strong data-start=3D"6219" data-e=
nd=3D"6243">Managed (persistent)</strong> : objet attach=C3=A9 au contexte =
de persistence</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6289" data-end=3D"6364">
<p data-start=3D"6291" data-end=3D"6364"><strong data-start=3D"6291" data-e=
nd=3D"6303">Detached</strong> : objet d=C3=A9tach=C3=A9 du contexte (ex : a=
pr=C3=A8s fermeture session)</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6365" data-end=3D"6410">
<p data-start=3D"6367" data-end=3D"6410"><strong data-start=3D"6367" data-e=
nd=3D"6378">Removed</strong> : objet marqu=C3=A9 pour suppression</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"6412" data-end=3D"6491">Hibernate g=C3=A8re automatiquemen=
t ces =C3=A9tats via l=E2=80=99<code data-start=3D"6459" data-end=3D"6474">=
EntityManager</code> ou la <code data-start=3D"6481" data-end=3D"6490">Sess=
ion</code>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"6493" data-end=3D"6496">
<p data-start=3D"6498" data-end=3D"6514">&lt;a name=3D"9"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</p>
<h2 data-start=3D"6515" data-end=3D"6570">9. Gestion des identit=C3=A9s et =
m=C3=A9thodes equals/hashCode</h2>
<p data-start=3D"6572" data-end=3D"6737">Pour assurer la coh=C3=A9rence et =
=C3=A9viter les probl=C3=A8mes dans les collections, il faut impl=C3=A9ment=
er <code data-start=3D"6664" data-end=3D"6674">equals()</code> et <code dat=
a-start=3D"6678" data-end=3D"6690">hashCode()</code> sur la cl=C3=A9 primai=
re ou un identifiant naturel.</p>
<p data-start=3D"6739" data-end=3D"6752"><strong data-start=3D"6739" data-e=
nd=3D"6752">Exemple :</strong></p>
<pre class=3D"overflow-visible!" data-start=3D"6754" data-end=3D"7019"><div=
