<h2 data-start=3D"1008" data-end=3D"1049">1. =F0=9F=A7=AD Introduction aux =
annotations JPA</h2>
<p data-start=3D"1051" data-end=3D"1089">Les annotations en JPA permettent =
de :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1091" data-end=3D"1363">
<li data-start=3D"1091" data-end=3D"1159">
