104" data-end=3D"1120">classes Java</strong> =C3=A0 des <strong data-start=
=3D"1127" data-end=3D"1137">tables</strong> de la base de donn=C3=A9es</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1160" data-end=3D"1200">
<p data-start=3D"1162" data-end=3D"1200">D=C3=A9finir les <strong data-star=
t=3D"1174" data-end=3D"1200">relations entre objets</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1201" data-end=3D"1249">
