art=3D"1217" data-end=3D"1249">r=C3=A8gles de g=C3=A9n=C3=A9ration de cl=C3=
=A9s</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1250" data-end=3D"1289">
<p data-start=3D"1252" data-end=3D"1289">G=C3=A9rer le <strong data-start=
=3D"1261" data-end=3D"1277">cycle de vie</strong> des entit=C3=A9s</p>
</li>
