</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3318" data-end=3D"3339">3.2 Concepts cl=C3=A9s</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3341" data-end=3D"3442">
<li data-start=3D"3341" data-end=3D"3381">
<p data-start=3D"3343" data-end=3D"3381">Cr=C3=A9ation de tokens sign=C3=A9=
