<hr data-start=3D"9410" data-end=3D"9413">
<h2 data-start=3D"9415" data-end=3D"9444">5. Gestion avanc=C3=A9e des JWT</=
h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"9446" data-end=3D"9485">5.1 Renouvellement (refresh token=
s)</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"9487" data-end=3D"9676">
<li data-start=3D"9487" data-end=3D"9535">
<p data-start=3D"9489" data-end=3D"9535">Stocker un refresh token s=C3=A9cu=
ris=C3=A9 c=C3=B4t=C3=A9 client.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9536" data-end=3D"9615">
<p data-start=3D"9538" data-end=3D"9615">Endpoint pour demander un nouveau =
token d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s avec le refresh token valide.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9616" data-end=3D"9676">
<p data-start=3D"9618" data-end=3D"9676">Exemple : gestion via une table de=
 refresh tokens en base.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"9678" data-end=3D"9709">5.2 Invalidation des tokens</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"9711" data-end=3D"9919">
<li data-start=3D"9711" data-end=3D"9791">
<p data-start=3D"9713" data-end=3D"9791">JWT =C3=A9tant stateless, impossib=
le d=E2=80=99invalider un token c=C3=B4t=C3=A9 serveur directement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9792" data-end=3D"9919">
<p data-start=3D"9794" data-end=3D"9805">Solutions :</p>
<ul data-start=3D"9808" data-end=3D"9919">
<li data-start=3D"9808" data-end=3D"9881">
<p data-start=3D"9810" data-end=3D"9881">Maintenir une liste noire (blackli=
st) des tokens invalid=C3=A9s (ex: Redis).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"9884" data-end=3D"9919">
<p data-start=3D"9886" data-end=3D"9919">R=C3=A9duire la dur=C3=A9e de vie =
du token.</p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"9921" data-end=3D"9961">5.3 Gestion des r=C3=B4les et per=
missions</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"9963" data-end=3D"10123">
<li data-start=3D"9963" data-end=3D"10051">
<p data-start=3D"9965" data-end=3D"10051">Ajouter des claims personnalis=C3=
=A9s dans le JWT (exemple : <code data-start=3D"10021" data-end=3D"10049">"=
roles": ["ADMIN", "USER"]</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"10052" data-end=3D"10123">
<p data-start=3D"10054" data-end=3D"10123">Lors de la validation, extraire =
ces r=C3=B4les pour la gestion des droits.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"10125" data-end=3D"10128">
<h2 data-start=3D"10130" data-end=3D"10164">6. S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 et bonnes=
 pratiques</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"10166" data-end=3D"10511">
<li data-start=3D"10166" data-end=3D"10205">
<p data-start=3D"10168" data-end=3D"10205"><strong data-start=3D"10168" dat=
a-end=3D"10204">Ne jamais exposer la cl=C3=A9 secr=C3=A8te</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"10206" data-end=3D"10269">
<p data-start=3D"10208" data-end=3D"10269"><strong data-start=3D"10208" dat=
a-end=3D"10226">Utiliser HTTPS</strong> pour s=C3=A9curiser la transmission=
 des tokens.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"10270" data-end=3D"10360">
<p data-start=3D"10272" data-end=3D"10360"><strong data-start=3D"10272" dat=
a-end=3D"10315">Ne pas stocker JWT dans le localStorage</strong> (risque XS=
S), pr=C3=A9f=C3=A9rer les cookies HttpOnly.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"10361" data-end=3D"10400">
<p data-start=3D"10363" data-end=3D"10400"><strong data-start=3D"10363" dat=
a-end=3D"10399">Limiter la dur=C3=A9e de vie du token</strong>.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"10401" data-end=3D"10455">
<p data-start=3D"10403" data-end=3D"10455"><strong data-start=3D"10403" dat=
a-end=3D"10437">Valider strictement les tokens</strong> =C3=A0 chaque requ=
=C3=AAte.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"10456" data-end=3D"10511">
<p data-start=3D"10458" data-end=3D"10511"><strong data-start=3D"10458" dat=
a-end=3D"10495">Utiliser des algorithmes robustes</strong> (HS256, RS256).<=
/p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"10513" data-end=3D"10516">
<h2 data-start=3D"10518" data-end=3D"10557">7. Exemples pratiques et cas d=
=E2=80=99usage</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"10559" data-end=3D"10736">
<li data-start=3D"10559" data-end=3D"10583">
<p data-start=3D"10561" data-end=3D"10583">Protection d=E2=80=99API REST.</=
p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"10584" data-end=3D"10633">
<p data-start=3D"10586" data-end=3D"10633">Authentification Single Page App=
lication (SPA).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"10634" data-end=3D"10668">
<p data-start=3D"10636" data-end=3D"10668">Microservices s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9=
s via JWT.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"10669" data-end=3D"10736">
<p data-start=3D"10671" data-end=3D"10736">Gestion d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s bas=
=C3=A9e sur les r=C3=B4les (RBAC) ou permissions (ABAC).</p>
</li>
</ul>
