=A9nation directe dans les requ=C3=AAtes LDAP.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3315" data-end=3D"3408">
<p data-start=3D"3317" data-end=3D"3408"><strong data-start=3D"3317" data-e=
nd=3D"3338">Command Injection</strong> : ne jamais ex=C3=A9cuter de command=
es OS avec des entr=C3=A9es non contr=C3=B4l=C3=A9es.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"3410" data-end=3D"3413">
<h2 data-start=3D"3415" data-end=3D"3473">4. Broken Authentication (Authent=
ification d=C3=A9faillante)</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"3475" data-end=3D"3491">4.1 Probl=C3=A8me</h3>
<p data-start=3D"3493" data-end=3D"3611">Mauvaise gestion des identifiants,=
 des sessions, ou des tokens, permettant aux attaquants de compromettre des=
 comptes.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"3613" data-end=3D"3636">4.2 Risques en Java</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3638" data-end=3D"3759">
<li data-start=3D"3638" data-end=3D"3691">
<p data-start=3D"3640" data-end=3D"3691">Utilisation de mots de passe faibl=
es ou non hach=C3=A9s.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3692" data-end=3D"3731">
<p data-start=3D"3694" data-end=3D"3731">Gestion incorrecte des sessions HT=
TP.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3732" data-end=3D"3759">
<p data-start=3D"3734" data-end=3D"3759">Tokens JWT mal s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9s=
.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"3761" data-end=3D"3779">4.3 Pr=C3=A9vention</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"3781" data-end=3D"4090">
<li data-start=3D"3781" data-end=3D"3879">
<p data-start=3D"3783" data-end=3D"3879">Toujours <strong data-start=3D"379=
2" data-end=3D"3820">hacher les mots de passe</strong> avec un algorithme f=
ort (ex : BCrypt via Spring Security).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3880" data-end=3D"3945">
<p data-start=3D"3882" data-end=3D"3945">Utiliser des frameworks de s=C3=A9=
curit=C3=A9 =C3=A9prouv=C3=A9s (Spring Security).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3946" data-end=3D"3982">
<p data-start=3D"3948" data-end=3D"3982">Expirer les sessions correctement.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3983" data-end=3D"4000">
<p data-start=3D"3985" data-end=3D"4000">Utiliser HTTPS.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4001" data-end=3D"4090">
<p data-start=3D"4003" data-end=3D"4090">Protection contre les attaques par=
 force brute (ex : limite de tentative de connexion).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4092" data-end=3D"4095">
<h2 data-start=3D"4097" data-end=3D"4161">5. Sensitive Data Exposure (Expos=
ition des donn=C3=A9es sensibles)</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"4163" data-end=3D"4182">5.1 Description</h3>
<p data-start=3D"4184" data-end=3D"4271">Fuite de donn=C3=A9es critiques co=
mme mots de passe, num=C3=A9ros de carte, donn=C3=A9es personnelles.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"4273" data-end=3D"4289">5.2 Exemples</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4291" data-end=3D"4439">
<li data-start=3D"4291" data-end=3D"4343">
<p data-start=3D"4293" data-end=3D"4343">Stockage des mots de passe en clai=
r dans une base.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4344" data-end=3D"4394">
<p data-start=3D"4346" data-end=3D"4394">Transfert de donn=C3=A9es sensible=
s sans chiffrement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4395" data-end=3D"4439">
<p data-start=3D"4397" data-end=3D"4439">Logs contenant des informations se=
nsibles.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"4441" data-end=3D"4459">5.3 Pr=C3=A9vention</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"4461" data-end=3D"4662">
<li data-start=3D"4461" data-end=3D"4516">
<p data-start=3D"4463" data-end=3D"4516">Chiffrement des donn=C3=A9es sensi=
bles en base (ex : AES).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4517" data-end=3D"4553">
<p data-start=3D"4519" data-end=3D"4553">Transmission via HTTPS uniquement.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4554" data-end=3D"4616">
<p data-start=3D"4556" data-end=3D"4616">Masquage ou suppression des donn=
=C3=A9es sensibles dans les logs.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"4617" data-end=3D"4662">
<p data-start=3D"4619" data-end=3D"4662">Respecter la conformit=C3=A9 (RGPD=
, PCI-DSS...).</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"4664" data-end=3D"4667">
