<h2 data-start=3D"5582" data-end=3D"5634">7. Broken Access Control (Contr=
=C3=B4le d=E2=80=99acc=C3=A8s cass=C3=A9)</h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"5636" data-end=3D"5655">7.1 Description</h3>
<p data-start=3D"5657" data-end=3D"5770">Les utilisateurs peuvent acc=C3=A9=
der =C3=A0 des ressources ou fonctionnalit=C3=A9s auxquelles ils ne devraie=
nt pas avoir droit.</p>
<h3 data-start=3D"5772" data-end=3D"5788">7.2 Exemples</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5790" data-end=3D"5881">
<li data-start=3D"5790" data-end=3D"5830">
<p data-start=3D"5792" data-end=3D"5830">URL ou API non prot=C3=A9g=C3=A9es=
 correctement.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5831" data-end=3D"5881">
<p data-start=3D"5833" data-end=3D"5881">Mauvaise gestion des r=C3=B4les da=
ns Spring Security.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-start=3D"5883" data-end=3D"5901">7.3 Pr=C3=A9vention</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"5903" data-end=3D"6066">
<li data-start=3D"5903" data-end=3D"5950">
<p data-start=3D"5905" data-end=3D"5950">V=C3=A9rifier les droits d=E2=80=
=99acc=C3=A8s =C3=A0 chaque requ=C3=AAte.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"5951" data-end=3D"6019">
<p data-start=3D"5953" data-end=3D"6019">Utiliser des annotations s=C3=A9cu=
ris=C3=A9es (<code data-start=3D"5990" data-end=3D"6005">@PreAuthorize</cod=
e>, <code data-start=3D"6007" data-end=3D"6017">@Secured</code>).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"6020" data-end=3D"6066">
<p data-start=3D"6022" data-end=3D"6066">Ne jamais se fier aux contr=C3=B4l=
es c=C3=B4t=C3=A9 client.</p>
</li>
</ul>
