</li>
<li data-start=3D"8710" data-end=3D"8750">
<p data-start=3D"8712" data-end=3D"8750">Configuration s=C3=A9curis=C3=A9e =
de parser XML.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8751" data-end=3D"8816">
<p data-start=3D"8753" data-end=3D"8816">Mise en place d=E2=80=99un filtre =
XSS dans une application Spring Boot.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8817" data-end=3D"8877">
<p data-start=3D"8819" data-end=3D"8877">Exemple de d=C3=A9s=C3=A9rialisati=
