=3D"3545">COPY</code> : transfert du jar compil=C3=A9 dans l=E2=80=99image.=
</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3587" data-end=3D"3664">
<p data-start=3D"3589" data-end=3D"3664"><code data-start=3D"3589" data-end=
=3D"3597">EXPOSE</code> : indique que l=E2=80=99app =C3=A9coute sur ce port=
 (utile pour documentation).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3665" data-end=3D"3729">
<p data-start=3D"3667" data-end=3D"3729"><code data-start=3D"3667" data-end=
=3D"3679">ENTRYPOINT</code> : commande pour d=C3=A9marrer l=E2=80=99app dan=
s le conteneur.</p>
</li>
</ul>
